# Observability

Purpose:
  Observability pillars and requirements for the SDDRA system.

Observability: sddra

Pillars:
  - Logs: Structured logging with correlation IDs
  - Metrics: Business and technical metrics
  - Traces: Distributed tracing across services

Requirements:
  Logs:
    - All errors MUST be logged
    - All security events MUST be logged
    - Logs MUST include tenant_id, correlation_id, actor_id

  Metrics:
    - Request latency per endpoint
    - Error rate per service
    - Business metrics (payments, enrollments)

  Traces:
    - Every request MUST have trace_id
    - Trace MUST span all services
    - Trace MUST include .sdd stage information

Rules:
  [OBS1] All production services MUST emit metrics.
  [OBS2] All errors MUST be logged with context.
  [OBS3] Distributed tracing MUST be enabled.
   [OBS4] Alerts MUST be defined for critical paths.

State: +
